2d:["$","div",null,{"id":"intro","className":"tiptap-content","style":{"marginBottom":"3rem"},"itemProp":"articleBody","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"13pt"},"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":["$","em",null,{"children":"Learn to trade like the banks — not against them."}]}]}]}],["$","p","1",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)"},"children":"If you have ever placed a perfectly logical trade — only to watch the market reverse the moment you entered — you have already experienced Smart Money at work. The big banks, hedge funds, and institutional players move markets in ways that consistently trap retail traders. Smart Money Concept (SMC) trading teaches you to read those moves, stop being the victim, and start trading on the right side of the market."}]}],["$","p","2",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)"},"children":"This comprehensive guide breaks down every core SMC concept — Break of Structure, Change of Character, Liquidity Grabs, Order Blocks, and Fair Value Gaps — and shows you how to combine them into a single, high-probability trading strategy that works on Forex, Crypto, and beyond."}]}],["$","p","3",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)"},"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"By the end of this article you will understand:"}]}]}],["$","p","4",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)"},"children":"•"}],["$","span","1",{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"7pt"},"children":"      "}],["$","span","2",{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)"},"children":"What Smart Money is and why it matters"}]]}],["$","p","5",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)"},"children":"•"}],["$","span","1",{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"7pt"},"children":"      "}],["$","span","2",{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)"},"children":"How to read market structure using BOS and CHoCH"}]]}],["$