92:["$","p","107",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"children":"Important Note: "}],"Price does not always reach the midpoint of an FVG before reversing. Sometimes it merely touches the edge and rockets in the other direction. There is no universally right or wrong entry — choose your approach and apply it consistently."]}]}]
