9a:["$","p","115",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)"},"children":"After the liquidity grab, wait for the CHoCH. This is non-negotiable — do not skip this step. For a buy trade, price must break above the most recent Lower High. For a sell trade, price must break below the most recent Higher Low. Only when this structural shift is confirmed should you move to the next step."}]}]
