9c:["$","p","117",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)"},"children":"Look at the impulsive move that caused the CHoCH. Within that move, identify the Fair Value Gap — the three-candle imbalance area. Mark it clearly with a rectangle. This is your entry zone. Now you wait."}]}]
