a3:["$","p","124",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)"},"children":"Scenario: A strong demand zone exists around 1.2600. Price approaches the zone, briefly dips below it to 1.2585 (liquidity grab), then closes back above 1.2600. Next, price breaks above the most recent Lower High — CHoCH confirmed. The impulsive move up creates a bullish FVG between 1.2610 and 1.2640. Price retraces back into the FVG midpoint at 1.2625."}]}]
a4:["$","p","125",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)"},"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Trade Execution: Buy at 1.2625. Stop loss at 1.2590 (below FVG). Take profit at 1.2730 (previous resistance). Risk: 35 pips. Reward: 105 pips. That is a 1:3 risk-to-reward ratio — a beautiful trade."}]}]}]
