d7:["$","p","176",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"children":"Final Thought: "}],"Mastering SMC trading is a process of rinse and repeat — the same concepts, applied to the same market, over and over until pattern recognition becomes instinct. Every chart you study, every trade you journal, and every loss you learn from brings you closer to trading at a level that most retail traders never reach. Stay patient, stay consistent, and you will get there."]}]}]
